      "sku": "U006",
      "type": "hub",
      "description": "四线逐脚并联的一分三 HY2.0-4P 扩展器。",
      "model": {
        "id": "passive-hub-u006",
        "status": "partial"
      },
      "parameters": {},
      "connector": {
        "type": "HY2.0-4P",
        "voltage": 5,
        "protocol": "parallel",
        "pins": [
          {
            "name": "GND",
            "direction": "ground"
          },
          {
            "name": "5V",
            "direction": "power"
          },
          {
            "name": "yellow",
            "direction": "bidirectional"
          },
          {
            "name": "white",
            "direction": "bidirectional"
          }
        ]
      },
      "dimensions": {
        "width": 24,
        "height": 32,
        "depth": 10.8,
        "unit": "mm",
        "sourceId": "official-docs"
      },
      "knowledgeUrl": "./knowledge/m5stack-unit-hub-u006.json",
      "docsUrl": "https://docs.m5stack.com/en/unit/Unit_Hub",
      "visual": {
        "status": "manufacturer-cad-shell",
        "modelUrl": "./assets/m5stack-unit-hub-u006/model.json",
        "limitations": [
          "当前仅支持 StopWatch Port A 上一层 U006，连接已适配的 U027/U003/U005；端口同针争用、级联 Hub 与任意 I²C 器件未实现。",
          "U006 是四线逐脚并联，不增加 GPIO、不分配 I²C 地址；未模拟供电电流、压降、总线电容或接触电阻。",
          "厂家 STL 仅有外壳，保留毫米坐标并剔除打印排版重复件；内部 PCB 为 UNKNOWN 占位。",
          "侧向入口线序由背贴交叉核对；三只正面出口的物理 pin1 方位缺少逐针证据，暂不显示出口线缆。网表并联关系有官方原理图依据。",
          "连接器壳体按官方尺寸图与照片近似；隐藏插合深度、纹理透视、内部布局及实机行为未核验。"
        ]
      },
